flowchart TD
  SRC[GitHub Actions / agent invocation] --> EVT[Canonical sanitized event contract]
  SRC2[platform201 / n8n adapters] --> EVT
  SRC3[Temporal workflows and activities] --> EVT
  EVT --> VAL[Schema + identity + privacy validation]
  VAL --> RAW[Immutable JSONL evidence + receipt]
  RAW --> RED[Pure reducers: ATES / WTCV / quality metrics]
  RED --> EQ[Equation registry + Wolfram reference checks]
  RAW --> COR[Run / attempt / SHA / cohort correlation]
  COR --> SHE[SHE projections and historical corpus]
  EQ --> SHE
  SHE --> AD[Dashboards / reports / research adapters]
  AD --> LANG[Langfuse / Phoenix / Hex optional adapters]
  SHE --> DOC[Versioned docs + Mermaid / SVG / Equation.io views]
  DOC --> REVIEW[Human review and promotion gate]
  REVIEW --> LOOP[Observe → compare → learn → repeat]
  LOOP --> SRC
